        <mxCell id="legend-edge-async-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;background sync&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="342" y="1278" width="168" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-edge-link" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=1.2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="290" y="1315" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="330" y="1315" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-edge-link-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;object reference, not traffic&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="342" y="1304" width="168" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1540" width="440" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · data plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; The instance sends WAL continuously and a base backup for every Backup object to s3://cnpg-&amp;lt;base&amp;gt;/ on Ceph RGW :7480, so any instant can be restored.&lt;br&gt;• Backup objects come from the ScheduledBackup (03:00), the pre-migration hook, or Back up now &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Retention 7 d by default (db.backup.retentionPolicy). The bucket is deleted with the app, unless keepAfterDelete (StorageClass ceph-bucket-retain).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="540" y="1200" width="420" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-bg" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background · control plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; The instance manager in the DB pod watches its Cluster and Backup objects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; The CNPG operator watches Cluster, Backup and ScheduledBackup objects.&lt;br&gt;• Not drawn: the shared Keycloak database backs up the same way to bucket cnpg-cnp-projects-keycloak at 02:00, 14 d, always on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD reads the app repo values and syncs the chart in waves: bucket claim -5, ObjectStore -4, Cluster -3, pre-migration Backup -2, migration Job -1, workloads 0.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt; The CMP commits db.backup.* (Settings toggle, project admin) or db.restore.* (restore) to the app repo, after showing the diff.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt; Back up now: the CMP creates a Backup &amp;lt;cluster&amp;gt;-manual-&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt; through the K8s API (ClusterRole cmp-security-reader).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="980" y="1200" width="460" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-migration" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7c3aed&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Backup before each migration (CNP-140)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• When the image tag changes, a Backup pre-&amp;lt;sha8&amp;gt; runs as a Sync hook (wave -2), then the migration Job (wave -1).&lt;br&gt;• The Job used to be PreSync: on a first sync it ran before the database existed and the app never synced.&lt;br&gt;• Argo CD waits on custom health checks: Cluster Healthy, Backup completed (Degraded on failure).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1460" y="1200" width="300" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-clouds" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d97706&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;On EKS and GKE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• No backup: no barman plugin, no ObjectBucketClaim CRD, and RGW is not reachable through the tunnel (relays 18080, 18082, 18083 only).&lt;br&gt;• Databases sit on local-path and are lost at cnp.sh down. Cloud backups are CNP-165.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1780" y="1200" width="260" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps between docs and code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;GB1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Credentials.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The S3 keys are a Secret made by Rook with the bucket, not a Vault secret.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;GB2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Transport.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Backups go to http://192.168.1.110:7480 in clear, on the LAN.&lt;br&gt;• The PRA page (04-disaster-recovery) predates this: it describes a SQLite CMP and no app database backup.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2060" y="1200" width="260" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
